WEBVTT

01:50.259 --> 01:53.930
[Love Between Lines]

01:54.280 --> 01:56.789
[Episode 13]

02:00.750 --> 02:02.780
[Sold]
[See you]

02:04.350 --> 02:05.200
Take care.

02:05.870 --> 02:06.350
Bye-bye.

02:06.350 --> 02:06.880
Bye-bye.

02:06.950 --> 02:07.480
Bye-bye.

02:10.910 --> 02:11.950
He's here again?

02:12.870 --> 02:15.130
Seems like he's got other things in mind.

02:21.300 --> 02:22.829
Maybe I'm overthinking it.

02:27.030 --> 02:29.310
Five iced Americanos,
three specialty drinks.

02:29.310 --> 02:31.240
Trying to make me even busier, huh?

02:40.000 --> 02:41.280
It's the weekend. Why did you come here

02:41.280 --> 02:42.810
instead of resting at home?

02:43.079 --> 02:44.800
Because I have an uncanny knack
for foresight.

02:44.800 --> 02:46.040
I knew it would be busy

02:46.070 --> 02:48.020
in the café this evening.

02:49.840 --> 02:51.520
I've noticed you're pretty well informed

02:51.520 --> 02:54.280
about Qin Xiaoyi from Group A these days.

02:54.280 --> 02:56.740
He comes back
and you show up here right away.

02:57.310 --> 02:57.750
What,

02:57.750 --> 03:00.080
your boss isn't hounding you
to draw plans on weekends anymore?

03:00.080 --> 03:01.150
My project is finished,

03:01.150 --> 03:02.280
so I deserve a break.

03:03.120 --> 03:05.320
Besides, he's doing a side job himself.

03:06.310 --> 03:07.240
That intense?

03:07.630 --> 03:09.890
Even the boss has to take on
a side hustle?

03:10.430 --> 03:12.710
He really should learn a thing or two
from Mr. Pei.

03:12.710 --> 03:13.470
Pei Zhen?

03:14.030 --> 03:15.750
Didn't the Qian Jinxin matter
wrap up already?

03:15.750 --> 03:16.520
What's up with him now?

03:16.520 --> 03:17.710
He went to play over across the street.

03:17.710 --> 03:18.520
Where?

03:18.870 --> 03:21.110
At the murder mystery game place
across the street.

03:21.110 --> 03:22.200
When?

03:23.079 --> 03:24.760
About 10 minutes ago.

03:26.410 --> 03:28.310
You and that Mr. Pei, you two...

03:29.360 --> 03:30.490
Where are you going?

03:30.690 --> 03:31.950
I'll talk to you later.

03:33.230 --> 03:34.829
Always so jumpy.

03:40.400 --> 03:41.150
No need to run.

03:41.150 --> 03:42.630
Their session has already started.

03:42.630 --> 03:45.280
Qin Xiaoyi is in Group A for this session,
right?

03:45.280 --> 03:45.840
Yes.

03:46.030 --> 03:47.120
He was on leave before.

03:47.120 --> 03:48.630
Today is his first day back performing.

03:48.630 --> 03:50.760
Well, it hasn't been going on for long.

03:50.840 --> 03:51.750
Could you get me a ticket?

03:51.750 --> 03:52.840
Please.

03:53.200 --> 03:54.560
You've played so many times,

03:54.560 --> 03:55.680
so you should know the rules.

03:55.680 --> 03:57.480
We don't admit latecomers here.

03:58.310 --> 03:59.280
I'm practically a regular player now.

03:59.280 --> 04:00.470
Can't you make an exception?

04:00.470 --> 04:02.730
I'll take any role,
as long as I can get in.

04:03.520 --> 04:04.630
There's really nothing I can do.

04:04.630 --> 04:06.360
This session's already full.

04:06.360 --> 04:08.800
Besides, it's against our rules.

04:10.430 --> 04:11.150
Thanks.

04:25.170 --> 04:26.900
Where does this corridor lead?

04:27.560 --> 04:28.290
To the lobby.

04:28.830 --> 04:30.290
It's one of the fire exits.

04:44.430 --> 04:44.970
Hello,

04:45.000 --> 04:47.000
this is ME Murder Mystery Game Club.

04:52.870 --> 04:54.310
Is the signal bad?

05:17.870 --> 05:18.390
Hello,

05:18.800 --> 05:19.630
may I ask

05:19.630 --> 05:21.430
if you know the way to the casino?

05:22.920 --> 05:24.270
I think it's up ahead.

05:24.480 --> 05:24.800
Yes, right up ahead.

05:24.800 --> 05:25.730
That way, right?

05:26.240 --> 05:26.720
Yes.

05:26.720 --> 05:28.950
Just go straight and turn right.

05:29.070 --> 05:29.870
That's right.

05:30.310 --> 05:30.910
Thank you.

05:31.640 --> 05:33.700
I didn't know I had to make money here.

05:34.830 --> 05:36.490
You want to make money, right?

05:36.560 --> 05:37.430
Go find that guy—

05:37.430 --> 05:37.920
that guy

05:38.190 --> 05:38.950
in a suit.

05:38.950 --> 05:39.870
He can help you.

05:40.360 --> 05:42.270
He's the son of a gambling tycoon.

05:42.510 --> 05:43.190
At the casino,

05:43.190 --> 05:44.190
he never loses.

05:45.010 --> 05:46.420
You can ask him for help.

05:48.310 --> 05:50.040
Are you a staff member

05:50.040 --> 05:51.570
or playing some character?

05:53.040 --> 05:53.950
I'm a...

05:54.240 --> 05:55.159
Time traveler.

05:55.750 --> 05:57.159
A-A hidden character.

05:57.230 --> 05:58.920
I know there's a map in your bag.

05:58.920 --> 06:00.320
It's something he needs.

06:01.190 --> 06:03.510
Make sure to ask him to help you.

06:07.270 --> 06:08.200
There really is.

06:08.270 --> 06:09.730
Thank you, time traveler.

06:14.510 --> 06:15.360
Sir!

06:16.630 --> 06:17.490
Excuse me, sir!

06:18.120 --> 06:20.240
I heard you're the son of
a gambling tycoon,

06:20.240 --> 06:21.720
who makes a lot of money at the casino.

06:21.720 --> 06:22.800
You must've got the wrong person.

06:22.800 --> 06:24.240
Please take me along to make money.

06:24.240 --> 06:24.870
No, no.

06:25.040 --> 06:25.390
I... I...

06:25.390 --> 06:26.070
I have to go. I've got things to do
over there.

06:26.070 --> 06:27.360
Please. Let's go.

06:27.360 --> 06:27.750
Don't drag me.

06:27.750 --> 06:29.040
Take me along to make money.

06:29.040 --> 06:29.600
Let's go.

06:30.160 --> 06:30.720
Excuse me,

06:30.720 --> 06:31.850
do you have a ticket?

06:34.190 --> 06:36.220
I-I'm here to find someone.

06:37.990 --> 06:39.220
I'll be going then.

06:40.310 --> 06:40.870
Hold on!

06:41.620 --> 06:42.070
Control center,

06:42.070 --> 06:43.560
someone without a ticket
has entered the game.

06:43.560 --> 06:44.480
Do you copy, control center?

06:44.480 --> 06:45.940
Someone without a ticket
has entered the game!

06:45.940 --> 06:47.870
[CCTV Room]

06:46.950 --> 06:47.560
Fei.

06:47.920 --> 06:49.360
Pull up the CCTV footage for me.

06:49.360 --> 06:50.190
Let's see who's snuck in without a ticket.

06:50.190 --> 06:51.000
How brazen.

06:51.000 --> 06:51.750
Got it, Boss.

06:53.080 --> 06:54.080
Boss, she's here.

06:56.310 --> 06:57.240
Zoom in. Zoom in.

07:02.870 --> 07:03.720
It's her.

07:04.000 --> 07:04.630
Boss,

07:05.010 --> 07:06.190
I remember she's a regular player.

07:06.190 --> 07:07.190
What is she doing?

07:10.270 --> 07:12.360
Looks like he's searching for Qin Xiaoyi.

07:12.360 --> 07:12.920
Boss.

07:13.120 --> 07:14.100
She didn't change into costume.

07:14.100 --> 07:16.430
It won't be good
if other players see her like this.

07:16.430 --> 07:17.040
Zheng Qi. Zheng Qi.

07:17.040 --> 07:18.640
Do you copy? Please respond.

07:18.640 --> 07:20.390
Yes, you've reached Freckled Li.

07:20.390 --> 07:21.830
There's a female player
who didn't change into costume

07:21.830 --> 07:22.680
heading your way.

07:22.680 --> 07:24.190
Stop her and bring her out.

07:24.430 --> 07:25.360
Copy that.

07:25.360 --> 07:27.680
I think it should be here.

07:29.950 --> 07:30.600
Excuse me,

07:30.600 --> 07:31.680
you have to leave now.

07:31.680 --> 07:32.510
Freckled Li,

07:32.510 --> 07:33.310
give me some time.

07:33.310 --> 07:35.000
I'll leave as soon as I see Qin Xiaoyi.

07:35.000 --> 07:35.870
No can do.

07:35.870 --> 07:36.560
Boss said

07:36.560 --> 07:37.360
you have to leave now.

07:37.360 --> 07:38.360
What you're doing is
against the rules, you know?

07:38.360 --> 07:39.270
As soon as I see Qin Xiaoyi,

07:39.270 --> 07:40.070
I'll say just one thing

07:40.070 --> 07:41.180
and leave right away.

07:41.180 --> 07:42.310
How about this? You can follow me.

07:42.310 --> 07:43.840
I promise I won't cause any trouble, okay?

07:43.840 --> 07:44.640
No.

07:44.670 --> 07:46.750
You're already causing trouble
just by being here.

07:46.750 --> 07:47.750
Leave. Leave now.

07:48.510 --> 07:49.210
Come here, guys!

07:49.210 --> 07:50.390
Freckled Li is handing out a new mission!

07:50.390 --> 07:51.390
H-He's handing out a new mission!

07:51.390 --> 07:52.159
You've got a new mission?

07:52.159 --> 07:52.510
Right, talk to him.

07:52.510 --> 07:53.570
What mission is it?

07:54.710 --> 07:55.840
There's no mission.

07:56.270 --> 07:57.159
I've got no clues here.

07:57.159 --> 07:58.040
No clues at all.

08:05.520 --> 08:06.850
I've finally found you.

08:07.760 --> 08:08.690
Why are you here?

08:11.680 --> 08:12.540
Commander Qin.

08:12.560 --> 08:13.950
I've got important matters
to discuss with you.

08:13.950 --> 08:15.150
Come with me for a bit.

08:17.360 --> 08:18.410
Excuse me.

08:34.740 --> 08:36.950
So you're here, my contact up the chain,

08:37.530 --> 08:39.370
Qin Xiaoyi.

09:01.790 --> 09:03.640
Why did you barge in here?

09:04.750 --> 09:05.630
I'm sorry.

09:06.240 --> 09:07.150
May I ask

09:08.200 --> 09:10.030
when Qin Xiaoyi will come out?

09:10.510 --> 09:11.150
Mr. Pei.

09:11.750 --> 09:12.960
A murder mystery game here

09:12.960 --> 09:14.220
lasts at least 4 hours,

09:14.400 --> 09:16.970
and Qin Xiaoyi is the one
with the highest win rate.

09:16.970 --> 09:18.780
I don't think you're so idle

09:18.810 --> 09:21.070
as to wait until this game's over, right?

09:22.080 --> 09:23.630
Ms. Hu, you know this place so well.

09:23.630 --> 09:25.430
Sounds like you come here often.

09:25.790 --> 09:28.030
Since Zhuling lost the Design Competition,

09:28.030 --> 09:29.910
I've indeed got plenty of time to spare.

09:29.910 --> 09:30.970
I can afford to wait

09:31.350 --> 09:32.680
this little bit of time.

09:41.480 --> 09:42.810
Alright, let's do that.

09:45.240 --> 09:46.390
Why did you come out here as well?

09:46.390 --> 09:47.720
The game isn't over yet.

09:48.750 --> 09:49.390
I lost.

09:49.840 --> 09:50.840
So fast?

09:52.390 --> 09:54.080
You didn't deliberately lose

09:54.080 --> 09:55.360
to get out early, did you?

09:55.360 --> 09:58.290
My professional integrity
wouldn't allow me to do that.

09:58.290 --> 09:59.650
S-So you...

10:00.750 --> 10:01.750
I got distracted.

10:02.120 --> 10:02.630
You, oh you.

10:02.630 --> 10:04.180
Just put your mind at ease.

10:04.200 --> 10:05.710
What could I possibly do to Hu Xiu?

10:05.710 --> 10:07.240
I wasn't talking about you.

10:10.720 --> 10:13.050
What business do you have with Qin Xiaoyi?

10:14.030 --> 10:14.750
I...

10:16.720 --> 10:17.740
You'd better be honest.

10:17.740 --> 10:19.200
I saw everything just now.

10:19.320 --> 10:20.440
This is my fault.

10:21.480 --> 10:23.480
I think it was probably because of me

10:23.600 --> 10:25.170
that Ms. Hu barged in here.

10:26.030 --> 10:27.080
Because of you?

10:27.370 --> 10:29.300
Was it because of you or Qin Xiaoyi?

10:40.000 --> 10:41.150
Ms. Hu

10:41.550 --> 10:42.550
probably didn't want me to recognize

10:42.550 --> 10:43.790
this NPC here.

10:48.260 --> 10:49.590
I also just found out myself

10:49.590 --> 10:50.830
that he works here.

10:55.750 --> 10:56.750
Let me introduce.

10:57.400 --> 10:58.920
Qin Xiaoyi here...

11:02.660 --> 11:04.060
He's my younger brother.

11:10.080 --> 11:11.080
Younger brother?

11:28.330 --> 11:29.990
Ms. Hu, are you waiting for me?

11:32.180 --> 11:35.510
Why did you suddenly come to
this murder mystery game place?

11:36.690 --> 11:38.060
Zhiyu didn't tell us

11:38.190 --> 11:39.430
that he works here.

11:39.770 --> 11:41.230
I only found out by chance.

11:42.200 --> 11:43.630
I was curious, so I wanted

11:43.630 --> 11:45.290
to come and confirm it myself.

11:51.120 --> 11:51.960
Don't worry,

11:52.470 --> 11:55.200
I won't make things difficult
for my own brother.

11:56.790 --> 11:58.910
Mr. Pei, when you deliberately
leaked news

11:58.910 --> 12:00.550
of Zhuling's cooperation with Yueheng

12:00.550 --> 12:02.750
on the lane hotel project ahead of time,

12:02.790 --> 12:05.850
you didn't care that Mr. Xiao
was your brother, did you?

12:07.790 --> 12:10.520
So this is what you've been upset about
all along.

12:11.800 --> 12:13.920
There are so many lanes
in the Jiangsu and Zhejiang area—

12:13.920 --> 12:15.180
it's nothing unusual.

12:15.310 --> 12:16.450
If the ideas happened to overlap,

12:16.450 --> 12:18.240
we can only say it was a coincidence.

12:18.240 --> 12:18.870
Besides,

12:19.840 --> 12:21.480
it was business competition to begin with—

12:21.480 --> 12:23.010
it's every man for himself.

12:23.020 --> 12:24.080
Do you understand?

12:25.390 --> 12:26.270
A coincidence?

12:26.790 --> 12:29.150
Fine, if you say it was a coincidence,
let's say it was.

12:29.150 --> 12:30.790
He won anyway.

12:35.150 --> 12:36.670
So in your opinion, Ms. Hu,

12:37.260 --> 12:38.740
I acted improperly

12:39.120 --> 12:40.250
and lacked ability,

12:40.600 --> 12:41.960
so I deserved to lose?

12:45.310 --> 12:47.440
But do you really know Xiao Zhiyu well?

12:48.240 --> 12:50.640
Is he really so upright
and proper himself?

12:53.160 --> 12:54.590
He's just a thief

12:54.960 --> 12:56.270
who, at the age of 12,

12:56.750 --> 12:58.260
dared to sneak into my father's study

12:58.260 --> 13:00.450
and try cracking the safe's code.

13:01.910 --> 13:02.820
A thief?

13:03.510 --> 13:04.510
What did he steal?

13:04.580 --> 13:06.380
What do you think was in the safe?

13:06.460 --> 13:08.660
How would I know what he wanted to steal?

13:09.240 --> 13:11.570
As a child, he dared to steal
from our home;

13:12.030 --> 13:14.080
and ever since he grew up,
he's been doing everything possible

13:14.080 --> 13:15.610
to humiliate the Pei family

13:15.630 --> 13:16.790
and Zhuling.

13:17.790 --> 13:18.480
Between him and me,

13:18.480 --> 13:20.870
it's never been
as simple as business competition.

13:20.870 --> 13:22.210
But what disappoints me most

13:22.210 --> 13:23.670
is that such a smart person

13:24.100 --> 13:25.620
as you, Ms. Hu,

13:26.240 --> 13:27.750
actually chose him.

13:35.390 --> 13:36.080
Let's go.

13:40.270 --> 13:42.330
Let's have lunch together tomorrow.

13:44.360 --> 13:47.020
To celebrate you
securing Lyman's new project.

13:47.240 --> 13:48.570
You know perfectly well

13:48.750 --> 13:49.750
whose idea it was.

14:11.390 --> 14:12.840
I was helping

14:12.840 --> 14:13.790
at Regard

14:13.910 --> 14:14.870
when I accidentally found out

14:14.870 --> 14:17.400
that Pei Zhen joined
the murder mystery game.

14:18.770 --> 14:19.890
I remember you said

14:20.390 --> 14:22.060
that only in murder mystery games

14:22.060 --> 14:23.990
could you not have to be Xiao Zhiyu.

14:24.390 --> 14:25.120
Although I don't know

14:25.120 --> 14:27.080
why you don't want to be Xiao Zhiyu,

14:27.910 --> 14:29.510
I'll make sure to preserve

14:29.510 --> 14:30.870
this sanctuary for you.

14:32.150 --> 14:33.550
It's just I didn't expect

14:33.920 --> 14:35.520
that he would still find out.

14:42.210 --> 14:43.870
Is he really your elder brother?

14:43.870 --> 14:44.510
No.

15:10.080 --> 15:10.870
Not by blood.

15:14.720 --> 15:15.510
I figured.

15:16.510 --> 15:18.110
You have different surnames

15:18.480 --> 15:20.010
and don't look alike at all.

15:21.030 --> 15:22.200
A blended family?

15:27.360 --> 15:28.600
It was a long time ago.

16:15.400 --> 16:16.930
I'm here to collect coffee.

16:22.440 --> 16:23.370
No need to check.

16:23.440 --> 16:24.900
I placed all these orders.

16:25.390 --> 16:27.240
I had no idea that you, Mr. Gong,

16:27.240 --> 16:28.120
loves

16:28.120 --> 16:29.650
Regard's coffee this much.

16:30.870 --> 16:33.050
I'm just getting it
for a young guy who works at our club.

16:33.050 --> 16:34.560
I only drink whiskey.

16:44.480 --> 16:45.000
Is that Pei Zhen

16:45.000 --> 16:46.660
really Xiao Zhiyu's brother?

16:51.200 --> 16:52.960
If it weren't for what happened yesterday,

16:52.960 --> 16:53.910
who would have known

16:53.910 --> 16:54.790
that his stepfather is

16:54.790 --> 16:57.400
such a renowned figure
in the construction industry?

16:57.400 --> 16:59.260
So why is he still working so hard?

16:59.290 --> 17:01.510
Haven't you known Mr. Xiao
for a long time?

17:01.510 --> 17:03.030
I have,

17:03.130 --> 17:04.790
but you know his temperament.

17:04.869 --> 17:07.599
It's not like
he reports everything to me, right?

17:08.160 --> 17:08.790
The two of us met

17:08.790 --> 17:10.750
when we were in college in America.

17:10.960 --> 17:12.069
In the college, apart from

17:12.069 --> 17:13.680
second-generation immigrants
and rich kids,

17:13.680 --> 17:16.069
there were only struggling students
supported by their entire families.

17:16.069 --> 17:18.000
Since he didn't bring up

17:18.240 --> 17:19.680
his family affairs himself,

17:19.680 --> 17:21.000
I wasn't in the right place to pry.

17:21.000 --> 17:21.589
So,

17:22.160 --> 17:24.160
what was he like back in America?

17:28.069 --> 17:29.680
Well, he...

17:32.350 --> 17:33.950
He was indeed quite unusual.

17:36.720 --> 17:37.880
His family

17:37.880 --> 17:39.810
never came to visit him in college,

17:40.790 --> 17:42.830
and he didn't socialize with
any of us classmates, either.

17:42.830 --> 17:44.400
Besides attending classes,

17:44.400 --> 17:45.750
he just worked part-time outside.

17:45.750 --> 17:47.810
He lived completely in his own world.

17:48.270 --> 17:50.350
We only met his mother

17:50.640 --> 17:52.000
on graduation day.

17:53.260 --> 17:55.350
But their relationship

17:56.310 --> 17:57.550
seemed...

17:58.310 --> 17:59.590
How did it seem?

18:00.590 --> 18:01.640
Well...

18:05.070 --> 18:06.070
They seemed

18:06.440 --> 18:07.640
very distant

18:07.880 --> 18:08.610
and awkward.

18:11.590 --> 18:12.110
Mom.

18:15.110 --> 18:16.240
Zhiyu, you're here.

18:16.410 --> 18:17.540
Come on, have a seat.

18:17.830 --> 18:18.590
Zhiyu.

18:19.070 --> 18:20.550
It's been ages. Why do I feel like

18:20.550 --> 18:22.030
you've lost even more weight?

18:22.030 --> 18:23.160
Come on, have a seat.

18:23.790 --> 18:24.920
You're here, Zhiyu.

18:29.570 --> 18:30.350
No drinks for me.

18:30.350 --> 18:31.240
Alright, sir.

18:31.510 --> 18:32.310
Zhiyu.

18:32.470 --> 18:33.310
Good boy.

18:34.220 --> 18:35.830
It's only been a few years,

18:36.110 --> 18:38.510
and you've turned an unknown small studio

18:38.510 --> 18:39.960
into what it is today.

18:40.440 --> 18:42.170
Your prospects are limitless.

18:45.240 --> 18:45.960
Zhiyu.

18:46.310 --> 18:48.110
Uncle Pei is complimenting you.

18:49.270 --> 18:50.200
You're too kind.

18:52.680 --> 18:53.940
You must all be hungry.

18:54.000 --> 18:54.720
Let's eat.

18:55.270 --> 18:55.880
Yeah.

18:56.160 --> 18:58.440
It's rare for our whole family
to be together.

18:58.440 --> 18:59.570
Let's start eating.

18:59.750 --> 19:00.350
Wanyue.

19:00.910 --> 19:02.060
I've ordered

19:02.400 --> 19:03.860
all your favorite dishes.

19:04.960 --> 19:05.550
Zhiyu.

19:05.990 --> 19:08.120
I specially ordered this fish for you.

19:11.350 --> 19:13.950
I forgot to ask them
to remove the green onions.

19:14.070 --> 19:15.000
Let me remove them for you.

19:15.000 --> 19:15.640
Mom,

19:16.160 --> 19:17.030
I can

19:17.440 --> 19:18.640
eat green onions now.

19:19.750 --> 19:21.280
But when you were little...

19:21.810 --> 19:23.930
That was all in the past.

19:41.490 --> 19:42.050
Mom.

19:42.790 --> 19:43.640
I remember you used to

19:43.640 --> 19:46.050
really love these
sweet and sour lotus root slices.

19:46.050 --> 19:47.050
Please have more.

19:47.200 --> 19:47.920
Mrs. Xiao,

19:47.920 --> 19:50.070
your blood sugar has been high
these past few years.

19:50.070 --> 19:51.790
I specifically ordered
many vegetarian dishes for you.

19:51.790 --> 19:52.790
Please eat more of those.

19:52.790 --> 19:54.520
Zhen, you still remember that?

20:06.510 --> 20:07.400
Zhiyu.

20:10.950 --> 20:12.780
I packed some food for you.

20:13.430 --> 20:15.040
You didn't eat anything just now.

20:15.040 --> 20:18.370
Work is important, but you need to
take care of yourself too.

20:20.470 --> 20:23.440
This is the restaurant's signature snack,

20:23.680 --> 20:24.510
called...

20:24.720 --> 20:25.780
Crab shell pastry.

20:25.800 --> 20:27.260
Right, crab shell pastry.

20:27.680 --> 20:28.790
You've been in Shanghai for years.

20:28.790 --> 20:30.790
You must've tried it before, right?

20:32.200 --> 20:32.720
Mom.

20:33.210 --> 20:36.340
I didn't know your blood sugar
had been high these years.

20:36.550 --> 20:38.410
It's nothing. Just a minor issue.

20:40.240 --> 20:40.970
I'm leaving.

21:05.200 --> 21:06.270
I've grown up.

21:07.400 --> 21:08.590
I make my own choice.

21:09.480 --> 21:10.410
As for the money,

21:10.820 --> 21:12.070
I'll figure something out myself.

21:12.070 --> 21:13.480
This isn't about money.

21:14.210 --> 21:16.110
Why do you have to study architecture?

21:16.110 --> 21:17.200
And you had to choose a college

21:17.200 --> 21:18.270
so far away from me.

21:39.440 --> 21:40.270
What are you standing there for?

21:40.270 --> 21:41.110
Come and help.

21:41.400 --> 21:42.110
Come on.

21:46.590 --> 21:47.520
Here comes help.

21:49.030 --> 21:49.830
Thank you.

21:51.490 --> 21:53.550
You pull that way, I'll pull this way.

22:06.700 --> 22:11.000
♪ Under the streetlight,
I grow increasingly weary ♪

22:12.790 --> 22:17.630
♪ A few specks of dust
drift by in the wind ♪

22:17.750 --> 22:18.960
Granny's back isn't in good shape,

22:18.960 --> 22:20.590
so she can't do the wringing.

22:20.100 --> 22:24.260
♪ The girl who once
basked in the sunlight ♪

22:21.310 --> 22:21.790
Here.

22:22.030 --> 22:23.440
Good thing you're back.

22:24.940 --> 22:27.860
♪ Where did she go to play? ♪

22:28.300 --> 22:31.280
♪ I don't understand either ♪

22:33.510 --> 22:37.340
♪ Flicking through old chat logs ♪

22:39.590 --> 22:44.480
♪ I just realized the replies
were somewhat delayed ♪

22:45.620 --> 22:51.610
♪ At the crossroads of choices,
amidst the bustling crowd ♪

22:52.840 --> 23:00.110
♪ Who hasn't paid the price
and still fallen short? ♪

23:00.410 --> 23:04.680
♪ Stand with me tonight,
look at the starlight ♪

23:05.710 --> 23:11.750
♪ Even if we're always
pushed aside by reality ♪

23:12.440 --> 23:18.660
♪ I know how hard it is to push forward ♪

23:18.110 --> 23:19.440
Thank you both so much.

23:19.200 --> 23:27.540
♪ But there are always people
in this world trying again like me ♪

23:19.720 --> 23:20.310
I made

23:20.310 --> 23:21.440
some sweet soup

23:21.440 --> 23:22.640
I'll bring it over for you in a bit.

23:22.640 --> 23:23.790
Thank you then.

23:24.070 --> 23:24.920
No need to bring it upstairs.

23:24.920 --> 23:27.320
Just leave it on the rack
on the first floor.

23:30.560 --> 23:35.110
♪ Stand with me tonight,
look at the starlight ♪

23:35.920 --> 23:41.970
♪ Even if the plot is changed dramatically
by fate again ♪

23:42.660 --> 23:49.380
♪ I know the dark clouds will still come ♪

23:49.410 --> 23:55.920
♪ But in this world,
there will always be someone ♪

23:58.480 --> 24:00.110
There're some pastries in that bag.
Help yourself.

23:58.480 --> 24:01.760
♪ Who looks forward
with the same hope as me ♪

24:04.110 --> 24:05.270
Crab shell pastry?

24:05.270 --> 24:06.200
You bought this?

24:07.880 --> 24:09.080
Someone gave it to me.

24:09.880 --> 24:10.710
That's a lot.

24:15.280 --> 24:15.760
Here.

24:20.790 --> 24:22.250
This is to warm your hands.

24:26.240 --> 24:27.000
It's okay.

24:27.000 --> 24:29.060
I'll just apply some hand cream on it.

24:43.880 --> 24:45.480
What are you doing with this?

24:57.480 --> 24:57.960
Here.

24:58.480 --> 24:59.540
Put your hand in it.

25:17.160 --> 25:18.550
If you want to protect your hands,

25:18.550 --> 25:20.280
this method is very effective.

25:21.790 --> 25:24.480
Mr. Xiao, I didn't know
you had this kind of knowledge.

25:24.480 --> 25:25.550
Back when I worked part-time abroad,

25:25.550 --> 25:26.880
washing dishes in the cold

25:26.880 --> 25:29.010
would make sores break out on my hands.

25:29.250 --> 25:31.450
Later, a coworker taught me this trick.

25:35.000 --> 25:35.640
You...

25:36.880 --> 25:37.480
What?

25:39.550 --> 25:40.720
I just never expected

25:40.720 --> 25:41.980
that someone like you,

25:42.480 --> 25:43.830
a golden boy,

25:44.240 --> 25:45.790
would do such hard labor.

25:46.030 --> 25:47.750
I'm no golden boy.

25:51.830 --> 25:53.310
He's just a thief,

25:53.480 --> 25:55.000
who, at the age of 12,

25:55.260 --> 25:56.890
dared to sneak into my father's study

25:56.890 --> 25:59.090
and try cracking the safe's code.

25:59.960 --> 26:01.240
How did it seem?

26:01.920 --> 26:03.000
They seemed

26:03.310 --> 26:04.480
very distant

26:04.610 --> 26:05.340
and awkward.

26:06.350 --> 26:07.440
How come?

26:07.720 --> 26:10.310
I only happened to hear about it later

26:10.310 --> 26:10.960
that

26:10.960 --> 26:12.200
his biological father passed away early,

26:12.200 --> 26:13.750
and his mother remarried soon after.

26:13.750 --> 26:14.510
He

26:14.600 --> 26:16.180
didn't want to spend
his stepfather's money,

26:16.180 --> 26:17.270
so he became independent at an early age

26:17.270 --> 26:18.330
and left that home.

26:23.030 --> 26:24.400
Did you

26:24.430 --> 26:26.350
have a really hard life back then?

26:35.000 --> 26:36.130
I'm going upstairs.

26:41.890 --> 26:43.890
Remember to apply it yourself, too.

27:07.110 --> 27:09.030
Wang also wanted to come,

27:10.270 --> 27:12.000
but he really couldn't make it.

27:13.240 --> 27:15.170
Guangming really pushes himself.

27:15.830 --> 27:17.130
There's no other choice.

27:17.130 --> 27:18.830
He's running back and forth
between two sides right now,

27:18.830 --> 27:20.230
and the pressure's huge.

27:20.680 --> 27:21.350
Yeah.

27:22.160 --> 27:23.440
If you need any help,

27:23.440 --> 27:24.510
just let me know.

27:25.310 --> 27:26.440
What's on your mind?

27:30.920 --> 27:31.960
So,

27:31.960 --> 27:33.000
that Qin Xiaoyi from Group A

27:33.000 --> 27:34.110
is your boss?

27:34.720 --> 27:36.030
And that fengshui master

27:36.030 --> 27:37.350
is Gong Huaicong?

27:38.680 --> 27:40.000
I didn't say anything at first

27:40.000 --> 27:42.600
because I was worried
my boss would silence me.

27:43.680 --> 27:44.550
Because in their club,

27:44.550 --> 27:45.440
except for Mr. Gong,

27:45.440 --> 27:47.640
no one knows about his second identity.

27:48.680 --> 27:49.680
What about later?

27:50.920 --> 27:53.070
Later, it was out of
my own selfish motive.

27:53.070 --> 27:53.920
Well,

27:55.720 --> 27:56.110
I just think

27:56.110 --> 27:58.910
he really enjoys
playing the murder mystery game.

27:59.720 --> 28:02.000
You didn't want anyone to spoil his fun.

28:02.110 --> 28:05.310
That's why you rushed over
to stop Mr. Pei that day, right?

28:06.440 --> 28:07.240
Xiu.

28:07.960 --> 28:08.960
I think

28:08.960 --> 28:10.420
you've got other feelings

28:11.270 --> 28:12.720
for Xiao Zhiyu.

28:15.270 --> 28:16.030
Look,

28:16.230 --> 28:18.000
if you only saw him as your boss,

28:18.510 --> 28:20.070
you'd only care about

28:20.510 --> 28:21.480
the rent bills

28:21.480 --> 28:23.550
and the results of the games,
things like that.

28:23.550 --> 28:25.590
But now, you care about his feelings

28:25.590 --> 28:27.120
and you want him to be happy.

28:27.680 --> 28:28.310
I...

28:29.100 --> 28:29.660
Also,

28:29.720 --> 28:31.160
I think his feelings for you

28:31.160 --> 28:32.560
aren't so simple either.

28:32.960 --> 28:34.110
He's living at your place,

28:34.110 --> 28:35.710
supposedly for the project.

28:35.920 --> 28:38.030
But the fact that
he agreed to be your roommate—

28:38.030 --> 28:39.430
roommates of all things—

28:39.720 --> 28:41.580
that's a bit hard to make sense of.

28:42.680 --> 28:45.080
A man and a woman living together,
you know?

28:45.510 --> 28:46.200
Xiu.

28:46.400 --> 28:49.880
I think your spring is
just around the corner.

29:06.550 --> 29:08.070
Let's move to another place.

29:08.070 --> 29:09.440
Waiter, check please.

29:10.920 --> 29:11.920
I'll pay.

29:12.720 --> 29:14.560
-I know you spoil me the most, Xiu.
-This is the receipt.

29:14.560 --> 29:15.890
It's 380 yuan in total.

29:16.400 --> 29:18.350
We're celebrating our restaurant's
second anniversary lately.

29:18.350 --> 29:20.210
Here's a customized gift for you.

29:20.400 --> 29:21.160
Thank you.

29:29.270 --> 29:30.440
Today, we received

29:30.640 --> 29:33.640
Lyman's authorization letter
for the design intent.

29:33.720 --> 29:34.350
This project

29:34.350 --> 29:35.480
is finally secured.

29:36.110 --> 29:38.070
There have been
quite a few issues recently.

29:38.070 --> 29:39.790
This result is thanks to
everyone's hard work.

29:39.790 --> 29:42.320
You'll definitely get
your project bonuses.

29:42.730 --> 29:43.390
Excellent!

29:46.120 --> 29:47.030
Today,

29:47.050 --> 29:49.640
Mr. Wu from Huasheng Materials
is also here with us.

29:49.640 --> 29:50.640
Thank you, Mr. Wu,

29:50.920 --> 29:52.910
for taking time to attend
our celebration banquet.

29:52.910 --> 29:53.940
We also hope

29:54.030 --> 29:55.640
you'll continue to support us, Mr. Wu.

29:55.640 --> 29:56.350
Don't mention it.

29:56.350 --> 29:58.000
It's our honor

29:58.000 --> 29:59.660
to collaborate with D Studio.

30:00.030 --> 30:00.480
Come on,

30:00.480 --> 30:02.310
let's all raise a toast to Mr. Wu.

30:02.310 --> 30:02.590
Come on.

30:02.590 --> 30:03.550
Alright, to Mr. Wu!

30:03.550 --> 30:05.070
Here's to the smooth progress
of our project.

30:05.070 --> 30:05.510
Cheers.

30:05.510 --> 30:06.710
Don't drink too much.

30:06.880 --> 30:08.030
Just a little bit.

30:08.200 --> 30:09.530
Don't be like last time.

30:12.110 --> 30:13.370
Cheers. To you, Mr. Wu.

30:21.960 --> 30:22.590
Hu Xiu,

30:22.790 --> 30:24.700
congratulations on passing probation.

30:24.700 --> 30:25.830
Passing probation?

30:26.550 --> 30:28.410
Aren't there still 2 months left?

30:29.000 --> 30:29.880
It's been moved up.

30:29.880 --> 30:31.540
Mr. Xiao already informed me.

30:31.920 --> 30:34.160
As expected from someone
I spotted from the beginning.

30:34.160 --> 30:34.720
Dong Qi.

30:36.110 --> 30:37.700
Weren't you looking for the restroom?

30:37.700 --> 30:38.500
I found it.

30:39.480 --> 30:41.140
Come on, I'll show you the way.

30:41.640 --> 30:42.270
Let's go.

30:58.110 --> 30:59.040
-Mr. Wu.
-Ms. Hu.

31:04.640 --> 31:05.500
No more drinks.

31:05.830 --> 31:06.670
Mr. Xiao said

31:06.720 --> 31:07.450
you couldn't

31:07.510 --> 31:08.680
hold your liquor, Ms. Hu.

31:08.680 --> 31:10.540
Better listen to Mr. Xiao, right?

31:14.830 --> 31:15.480
Ms. Hu.

31:16.470 --> 31:18.070
I heard from your colleagues

31:18.380 --> 31:21.210
that you used to work
at a real estate company.

31:21.790 --> 31:22.240
Yes.

31:24.830 --> 31:26.270
From real estate

31:26.600 --> 31:28.510
to architectural design—

31:29.830 --> 31:31.830
it must've been hard for you, Ms. Hu.

31:32.590 --> 31:34.350
This industry is quite demanding.

31:34.350 --> 31:36.130
If you want to achieve something,

31:36.130 --> 31:37.660
you have to sacrifice a lot.

31:38.590 --> 31:40.550
Compared to rough guys like us,

31:41.110 --> 31:43.550
it's even harder for you young ladies.

31:45.960 --> 31:46.750
However,

31:46.920 --> 31:48.320
with Mr. Xiao's support,

31:48.550 --> 31:49.440
Ms. Hu,

31:49.560 --> 31:51.690
you're much luckier than most people.

31:52.000 --> 31:53.160
Especially the fact that Mr. Xiao

31:53.160 --> 31:54.760
is such a talented young man.

31:54.920 --> 31:56.110
A man with such potential

31:56.110 --> 31:57.550
is rare to come by.

32:00.930 --> 32:02.170
This mushroom

32:02.200 --> 32:03.400
tastes a bit strange.

32:03.590 --> 32:04.510
Just like I find

32:04.510 --> 32:06.570
what you just said quite strange too.

32:09.110 --> 32:10.240
You misunderstood.

32:11.010 --> 32:13.410
I didn't mean anything negative about you.

32:14.310 --> 32:15.440
I just thought

32:16.230 --> 32:18.030
if there are suitable projects
in the future,

32:18.030 --> 32:19.560
we could collaborate more.

32:19.830 --> 32:20.630
Mr. Wu,

32:20.920 --> 32:23.650
I'm not the one
who can decide on collaborations.

32:24.110 --> 32:24.980
I understand.

32:25.000 --> 32:26.170
I spoke out of turn.

32:29.640 --> 32:31.680
Mr. Xiao, you've finished your business?

32:31.680 --> 32:34.350
Ms. Hu and I were having a nice chat.

32:38.960 --> 32:39.510
Hu Xiu.

32:40.160 --> 32:41.550
There's a conference call in 5 minutes.

32:41.550 --> 32:42.400
Come with me.

32:50.880 --> 32:51.480
Mr. Xiao.

32:51.680 --> 32:52.940
What conference call?

32:54.880 --> 32:56.740
What did Mr. Wu say to you just now?

32:58.920 --> 32:59.680
Nothing.

33:00.240 --> 33:01.520
Then why are you upset?

33:02.590 --> 33:03.830
I'm not.

33:08.640 --> 33:09.960
You weren't even there just now.

33:09.960 --> 33:11.560
How could you know I'm upset?

33:13.430 --> 33:15.290
Actions speak louder than words.

33:20.110 --> 33:20.880
Do you know

33:21.480 --> 33:23.210
that you've always had a habit?

33:26.030 --> 33:27.400
Whenever you're upset,

33:28.750 --> 33:30.410
you fidget with your fingers.

33:33.830 --> 33:34.640
I'm okay.

33:35.240 --> 33:36.930
I just tripped accidentally.

33:48.880 --> 33:52.340
Mr. Xiao, you seem to enjoy
observing your subordinates a lot.

33:53.590 --> 33:54.750
Can you tell me now?

33:55.550 --> 33:56.880
What happened just now?

33:59.590 --> 34:01.000
He underestimated me.

34:01.920 --> 34:04.160
But it doesn't matter
what he thinks of me.

34:04.160 --> 34:05.830
As long as his
3D spatial construction technology

34:05.830 --> 34:08.360
can help our studio,
that's all that matters.

34:15.670 --> 34:16.320
Stop.

34:16.590 --> 34:17.120
Mr. Xiao,

34:17.230 --> 34:18.690
please stop observing me.

34:20.340 --> 34:22.070
I couldn't care less about you.

35:15.150 --> 35:15.880
Mr. Xiao.

35:16.480 --> 35:17.230
Why didn't you wake me up

35:17.230 --> 35:18.920
when we arrived?

35:21.100 --> 35:22.670
I've got nothing urgent to do.

35:22.670 --> 35:23.320
Get off.

35:49.590 --> 35:51.320
You did that on purpose, didn't you?

35:51.320 --> 35:51.920
Mr. Xiao.

35:52.880 --> 35:54.960
I couldn't get any strength.

35:54.960 --> 35:55.400
I just

35:55.790 --> 35:57.270
couldn't open this.

35:57.550 --> 35:58.320
Cut it out.

35:58.510 --> 35:59.920
I've used this trick before.

35:59.920 --> 36:00.510
Get off.

36:06.320 --> 36:06.880
I'm okay.

36:08.230 --> 36:08.980
Well then.

36:42.150 --> 36:43.000
Snow?

36:43.690 --> 36:44.850
It's snowing.

37:29.550 --> 37:30.150
Mr. Xiao,

37:30.630 --> 37:31.630
it's really snowing.

37:31.630 --> 37:32.320
Look.

37:33.240 --> 37:33.880
Hu Xiu,

37:34.470 --> 37:35.990
are you hallucinating?

37:36.480 --> 37:36.960
I

37:46.550 --> 37:47.320
think

37:47.880 --> 37:49.940
there are flower petals falling too.

38:04.700 --> 38:09.250
♪ Close your eyes for me ♪

38:10.770 --> 38:12.940
♪ Don't rush to wake up ♪

38:13.420 --> 38:16.640
♪ Before the night ends ♪

38:15.000 --> 38:16.000
Mr. Xiao, look.

38:17.030 --> 38:18.690
These are real flower petals.

38:19.520 --> 38:24.840
♪ Will you stay with me? ♪

38:25.760 --> 38:27.760
♪ I won't search for ♪

38:28.560 --> 38:31.370
♪ The reason we met ♪

38:33.180 --> 38:38.710
♪ The city gradually turns pale
outside the window ♪

38:40.090 --> 38:42.210
♪ The stars twinkle ♪

38:43.200 --> 38:47.210
♪ I've quieted down ♪

38:45.230 --> 38:47.150
Qin Xiaoyi.

38:48.830 --> 38:49.800
What did you just call me?

38:48.940 --> 38:52.140
♪ What kind of story will you like? ♪

38:52.260 --> 38:53.920
♪ Would you join me? ♪

38:53.950 --> 38:57.710
♪ To make a long, romantic dream ♪

38:58.430 --> 39:01.000
♪ Just you and me ♪

39:03.720 --> 39:05.900
♪ Briefly, beyond the clamor ♪

39:05.930 --> 39:07.910
♪ Carefully drawing close to you ♪

39:07.940 --> 39:11.380
♪ Clinging to that trace of unknown joy ♪

39:11.820 --> 39:15.510
♪ Oh, special night ♪

39:18.570 --> 39:23.260
♪ I need you maybe ♪

39:24.550 --> 39:26.550
♪ The crowds are gone ♪

39:27.230 --> 39:30.760
♪ My thoughts have sunk to the bottom ♪

39:32.880 --> 39:38.010
♪ Maybe you never noticed me at all ♪

39:37.150 --> 39:38.670
There's something

39:39.720 --> 39:45.260
♪ Yet you're in my view ♪

39:39.920 --> 39:41.650
I've always wanted to tell you—

39:45.000 --> 39:46.110
you've got

39:46.870 --> 39:49.410
♪ Escape the world ♪

39:46.960 --> 39:48.560
a really good-looking face.

39:49.440 --> 39:51.440
♪ Forget all things ♪

39:51.460 --> 39:54.820
♪ And fall down a long, romantic dream ♪

39:54.840 --> 39:57.150
♪ Just you and me ♪

39:57.840 --> 40:00.160
♪ Under moonlight ♪

40:02.520 --> 40:05.090
♪ Briefly, beyond the clamor ♪

40:05.130 --> 40:07.030
♪ Getting closer to you secretly ♪

40:07.050 --> 40:10.900
♪ Clinging to that trace of unknown joy ♪

40:11.290 --> 40:15.300
♪ Oh, special night ♪
